<#ff6a3c>HUNGER GAUGE / WILD WOLF</>
Wild Wolf (hunger gauge full)		^X
  Every hit he lands (or that gets blocked) feeds the wolf
  gauge (bottom of the screen). At full, X with no direction
  held is Wild Wolf: a short roar, then 8 seconds in which
  Power Wave, Burn Knuckle and Crack Shoot (and the Power
  Wave projectiles) do 35% more damage. It empties the gauge.
  The gauge also resets every round.
Palettes 1-6 = Normal Terry (Fire Kick, Trinity Geyser),
palettes 7-12 = EX Terry (Power Charge, Rising Force).

<#ff6a3c>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Jump		_U

<#ff6a3c>NORMALS</>
  Chain: A > B > C (standing, crouching and in the air), upward
  only, on hit or block. Any normal that connected also cancels
  into specials, EX moves and supers.
  A / B / C are his light / medium / heavy punches, X is his
  light kick.
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Light Kick		^X
Hammer Punch		_F^B
Rising Upper		_F^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Crouching Light Kick		_D^X
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Air Light Kick		^X

<#ff6a3c>SPECIALS</>
  C is the EX version (500 meter). Without the meter, C is
  the heavy version. Kick moves use X, and X_+^C for the EX.
Power Wave		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Round Wave		_D_DF_F^C
Burn Knuckle		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Crack Shoot		_D_DB_B^X
Rising Tackle		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Power Dunk		_F_D_DF^X
Fire Kick / Power Charge		_B_DB_D_DF_F^X

<#ff6a3c>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
EX Power Wave		_D_DF_F^C
EX Burn Knuckle		_D_DB_B^C
EX Crack Shoot		_D_DB_B^X_+^C
EX Rising Tackle		_F_D_DF^C
EX Power Dunk		_F_D_DF^X_+^C
EX Fire Kick / Power Charge		_B_DB_D_DF_F^X_+^C

<#ff6a3c>SUPERS</>
Buster Wolf (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Power Geyser (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B
Trinity Geyser / Rising Force (5 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
